<title>USA: Bell Atlantic Corp Q3 net off.</title>
<headline>Bell Atlantic Corp Q3 net off.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.10		    $1.38</p>
<p> Net			483,300		  604,800</p>
<p> Revs		   3,297,800		3,261,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 439,100		  438,500</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.29		    $3.35</p>
<p> Net		    1,448,100		1,466,400</p>
<p> Revs		   9,764,900	     10,275,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 439,600		  437,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 results include a $0.46 per share gain from the sale of cellular properties and a $0.09 per share loss from non-recurring business development charges. Without these items, adjusted earnings per share for 1995 would be $1.10 for the quarter and $2.98 for the nine months.  </p>
<p>First Call consensus estimate for the quarter was $1.09 per share.</p>
</text>
